Join us for an hour of groove, sweat, laughs and fun in African Dancing Sunshine Coast! Every Tuesday evening at 7-8pm @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall. Live drumming and a $5 dance class! Excellent for beginners and fantastic for experienced (come share your moves!). For lovers of all types of dancing, stomping and leaping. Suits all fitness levels, encourages self confidence and enhances fitness levels. Great community vibe with lots of laughs. Men, women and children welcome. Performance opportunities. For event details see [here](https://www.facebook.com/events/1444148742494881/ "African dancing sunshine coast") [![IMG\_6797](/media/2013/10/IMG_6797-1.jpg)](/media/2013/10/IMG_6797-1.jpg)
